{"4925290": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mansion of Oblivion", "steam_appid": 4925290, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oblivion... a moment surrounded by emptiness. No past, no future, only you — pure mind, pure soul.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in a damp basement, the Protagonist [Name Forgotten] finds himself bound by rusty chains. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/0b5cc8668ec7e1704892e6607457374b.poster.avif?t=1788036745\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/0b5cc8668ec7e1704892e6607457374b.webm?t=1788036745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/0b5cc8668ec7e1704892e6607457374b.mp4?t=1788036745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He remembers absolutely nothing about himself. The hero's only weapon against the rising panic and the nightmares of this place is biting cynicism and humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Here, you don’t leave. You stay” — this is not just a slogan, it is the very nature of the mansion. There is no way out, but is it even worth returning? ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...MAYBE IT'S BETTER HERE?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/b2145354ba8e47ccd11552cdb6f9fba7.poster.avif?t=1788036745\" width=500 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/b2145354ba8e47ccd11552cdb6f9fba7.webm?t=1788036745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/b2145354ba8e47ccd11552cdb6f9fba7.mp4?t=1788036745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CORE FEATURES AND GOALS:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sarcasm instead of fear</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark story awaits you, where a grim atmosphere goes hand in hand with goofy humor. The hero doesn’t tremble with terror; instead, he meets danger with mockery, turning a deadly trap into his own show.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/43a62bfd017610090878a0f65aed8597.avif?t=1788036745\" width=390 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration in defiance of the system</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignore orders, poke your nose into forbidden areas, search for clues, and solve puzzles. Go against the rules of the mansion to seize total control over it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/8d84e17699cd1cab553f71cb329788fb.poster.avif?t=1788036745\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/8d84e17699cd1cab553f71cb329788fb.webm?t=1788036745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/8d84e17699cd1cab553f71cb329788fb.mp4?t=1788036745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival in the dark</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The darkness here is tangible, and it is steeped in oblivion. Frantically manage your sanity meter and preserve your lamp's light. Manage a strict 9-slot inventory and hoard every single drop of oil.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/35ba26e0d3b12ee6156b793bbd96f8c5.poster.avif?t=1788036745\" width=300 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/35ba26e0d3b12ee6156b793bbd96f8c5.webm?t=1788036745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/35ba26e0d3b12ee6156b793bbd96f8c5.mp4?t=1788036745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mental duels in dialogues</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interacting with the deranged inhabitants is a psychological war. Non-linear, interactive dialogues will force you to weigh every single word, and your choices will lead to one of 5 completely different endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/e91b78e7690bfb40309bcec10f26e7e9.avif?t=1788036745\" width=554 height=346 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oblivion... a moment surrounded by emptiness. No past, no future, only you — pure mind, pure soul.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in a damp basement, the Protagonist [Name Forgotten] finds himself bound by rusty chains. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/0b5cc8668ec7e1704892e6607457374b.poster.avif?t=1788036745\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/0b5cc8668ec7e1704892e6607457374b.webm?t=1788036745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/0b5cc8668ec7e1704892e6607457374b.mp4?t=1788036745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He remembers absolutely nothing about himself. The hero's only weapon against the rising panic and the nightmares of this place is biting cynicism and humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Here, you don’t leave. You stay” — this is not just a slogan, it is the very nature of the mansion. There is no way out, but is it even worth returning? ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...MAYBE IT'S BETTER HERE?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/b2145354ba8e47ccd11552cdb6f9fba7.poster.avif?t=1788036745\" width=500 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/b2145354ba8e47ccd11552cdb6f9fba7.webm?t=1788036745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/b2145354ba8e47ccd11552cdb6f9fba7.mp4?t=1788036745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CORE FEATURES AND GOALS:</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sarcasm instead of fear</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark story awaits you, where a grim atmosphere goes hand in hand with goofy humor. The hero doesn’t tremble with terror; instead, he meets danger with mockery, turning a deadly trap into his own show.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/43a62bfd017610090878a0f65aed8597.avif?t=1788036745\" width=390 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration in defiance of the system</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignore orders, poke your nose into forbidden areas, search for clues, and solve puzzles. Go against the rules of the mansion to seize total control over it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/8d84e17699cd1cab553f71cb329788fb.poster.avif?t=1788036745\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/8d84e17699cd1cab553f71cb329788fb.webm?t=1788036745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/8d84e17699cd1cab553f71cb329788fb.mp4?t=1788036745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival in the dark</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The darkness here is tangible, and it is steeped in oblivion. Frantically manage your sanity meter and preserve your lamp's light. Manage a strict 9-slot inventory and hoard every single drop of oil.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/35ba26e0d3b12ee6156b793bbd96f8c5.poster.avif?t=1788036745\" width=300 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/35ba26e0d3b12ee6156b793bbd96f8c5.webm?t=1788036745\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/35ba26e0d3b12ee6156b793bbd96f8c5.mp4?t=1788036745\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mental duels in dialogues</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interacting with the deranged inhabitants is a psychological war. Non-linear, interactive dialogues will force you to weigh every single word, and your choices will lead to one of 5 completely different endings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/extras/e91b78e7690bfb40309bcec10f26e7e9.avif?t=1788036745\" width=554 height=346 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Camera, action, a new birth. Nothing before, nothing after, only oblivion. A dirty basement, chains. No name, no past, just a Victorian mansion playing with your mind. But you're not afraid; no, you love to play too. Let the show begin!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/51ad4343e6f3dbeff866718d1f5b79063032b141/header.jpg?t=1788036745", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/a91e3bb3401ae39dce533c9f1c67a3ce0795f866/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788036745", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4925290/a91e3bb3401ae39dce533c9f1c67a3ce0795f866/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788036745", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4160 / AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 260X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul cla